I wouldn't want to make too much of interrogative pronouns in IE languages,=
 since they are notoriously shifty (collapsing with relatives in one direct=
ion, for example).=A0 In a logical language, it is to be presumed that the =
roles is unmistakable. One might make a case that an "anywhere" answer to "=
Where are you going/ do you want to go?" somehow is derived from a sentence=
 still in the question frame work (one member -- or all the members -- of t=
he set of answers, I suppose).=A0 But such an extraction in Lojban should r=
equire some surface evidence and {ma kau}, at least, evidences the wrong ki=
nd of motion.=A0 I'm not sure what might work.



